Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a scalable OTCA path with privacy-first constraints, multi-region residency, dynamic redaction, and compliant purge workflows.

Key Concepts
- Per-tenant residency and data locality
- Dynamic, versioned redaction rules
- Immutable regional logs and global canonical events
- Canary rollouts and zero-downtime config reloads
- GDPR/CCPA purge and auditability

Code Example
```javascript
function redact(event, policy) {
  const out = { ...event };
  if (policy.redactPII && out.user?.email) delete out.user.email;
  if (policy.redactPhone && out.user?.phone) delete out.user.phone;
  return out;
}
```

Follow-up Questions
- How would you validate purge requests across regions with clock skew?
- Which metrics indicate redaction misfires under load and how would you triage them?

